headers {
  User-Agent: {{userAgent}}
  Accept: application/json
}

auth {
  mode: none
}

docs {
  warframe.market HTTP API — v2 (current) and v1 (legacy remnants).

  Every request in this collection was executed against the live API on
  2026-08-31 and returned 200 with a well-formed body. Endpoints that are
  documented but do not work (v1 routes removed, deprecated, or requiring
  credentials) are deliberately absent — see README.md for the exclusion list.

  Rate limit is 3 req/s (Cloudflare answers 429 over it, 509 on too many
  concurrent connections), so run the collection with a delay:

    bru run --env production --delay 400 -r
}
